  "size": 512,
  "name": "Four Crowns",
  "description": "Four highland colonies descend through slate escarpments to the Sunken Heart. Circle the lake, contest amber and root, and challenge 48 woodland camps, including eight T3 boss lairs. Four-player free-for-all; rich home forests and multiple approaches reward expansion and large armies.",
